# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore — flutter_claude_app_v2
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 任务来源: T01.3 配置 .gitignore 与 .gitattributes
# 设计原则:
#   1. 保留 Flutter 默认规则不删除（仅扩充）
#   2. 平台敏感文件（key.properties、Pods/、xcuserdata 等）由 android/.gitignore
#      与 ios/.gitignore 处理，本文件不重复
#   3. 生成代码（*.g.dart、*.freezed.dart 等）**不**在此忽略，保持随源码提交，
#      让 clone 后无需先跑 build_runner 即可 `flutter run`。如需改策略，请
#      取消第 「Build Runner generated code (opt-in ignore)」 节注释。
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Flutter / Dart / Pub
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication & Obfuscation
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio build artifacts
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated code (build_runner) — opt-in ignore
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uncomment the following lines if your team prefers to NOT commit generated
# files (you must then ensure CI runs `dart run build_runner build` before
# analyze/test). Default behavior: commit generated files for zero-setup clones.
#
# *.g.dart
# *.freezed.dart
# *.gr.dart
# *.config.dart
# *.mocks.dart

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test & Coverage
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/coverage/
*.lcov
test/.test_coverage.dart
.test_coverage/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs & temp
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history
.atom/
.build/
.buildlog/
.svn/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/

# Compiled class files
*.class

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE — IntelliJ / Android Studio
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE — VS Code
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 默认忽略 .vscode/ 下用户私有配置，但保留团队共享的 launch.json / tasks.json /
# extensions.json（T15.4 会提交三套环境的 launch.json）
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.template.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE — Other
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fleet
.fleet/
# Zed
.zed/
# Sublime Text
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
# Vim
[._]*.s[a-v][a-z]
[._]*.sw[a-p]
[._]s[a-v][a-z]
Session.vim
.netrwhist
tags

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code / Cursor / AI assistant local settings
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System — macOS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Icon?
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System — Windows
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System — Linux
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & Local config — NEVER commit these
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 通用 .env 家族（M15 / envied / dart-define-from-file）
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template

# 通用密钥与凭证文件
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.mobileprovision

# Service account / Firebase / 推送服务密钥
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/firebase-adminsdk-*.json

# 注：Android 的 key.properties 与 keystore 已由 android/.gitignore 处理
# 注：iOS 的 .xcconfig 不忽略，但用户私有 *.local.xcconfig 需忽略
**/*.local.xcconfig

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Profiling / Debug
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.cpuprofile
*.heapsnapshot
.flutter-devtools/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# M15 / T15.3 多环境编译期常量（含 API/DSN 等敏感值，不入库）
# 提交的是 env/*.example.json 模板；真实 env/*.json 本地从模板复制后填写。
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/env/*.json
!/env/*.example.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc local-only
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.tmp
.local/
local/
scratch/
TODO.local.md
NOTES.local.md
